            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co zwróci <code>\"red.blue green\".split()</code>, jeśli nie podano separatora?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>['red.blue', 'green']</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>['red', 'blue green']</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>['red', 'blue', 'green']</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>['red.blue', 'green']</code>.</p></body></html>",
