            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co wyświetla ten kod w konsoli?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"usernames = \" /><text value=\"&quot;aut_43 tommo rodger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"usernames_list = usernames.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(usernames_list)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['aut_43', 'tommo', 'rodger']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"false\"><code>aut_43 tommo rodger</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"true\"><code>['aut_43', 'tommo', 'rodger']</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\">Nic</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>['aut_43', 'tommo', 'rodger']</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jeśli zmienisz wywołanie na <code>usernames.split(\"_\")</code>, co będzie zawierać <code>usernames_list</code>?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"usernames = \" /><text value=\"&quot;aut_43 tommo rodger&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"usernames_list = usernames.split()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print(usernames_list)\" /></content><output><content><text value=\"['aut_43', 'tommo', 'rodger']\" /></content></output></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>['aut', '43 tommo rodger']</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>['aut_43', 'tommo', 'rodger']</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>['aut', '43', 'tommo', 'rodger']</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>['aut', '43 tommo rodger']</code>.</p></body></html>",
